*.log
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
# generated fork maps / per-fork Compose overrides (mkfork-generic writes them next to the adapters)
benchmarks/*/fork.map
benchmarks/*/compose/docker-compose.*-f*.yml
# per-run secrets minted by the adapters (Mastodon OAuth tokens etc.)
benchmarks/*/.token*
# TrainTicket's fork.map is committed (hand-written); keep it
!benchmarks/trainticket/fork.map
# per-run state the adapters write beside themselves (ids of the core objects they created,
# the captured index DDL a generator replays). Not secrets, but not evidence either.
benchmarks/*/.core-*
benchmarks/*/scale/.posts-indexes.sql
